// Export (v3 Task 12 split of js/app.js): the Save sheet for the photo in view (prepared as soon as it opens, so Share
// runs inside the tap), the device canvas cap, and batch export of several selected photos (ZIP or separate files).
// ---------- Save / export ----------
// The file is prepared as soon as the sheet opens (and again when an option changes), so that
// "Share" can call navigator.share() while the tap still counts as a user gesture.
// ↓ imports (generated by the v3 split; edit freely)
